-- This is a data-only dump of the development tenant. It contains:
--
--   * "Demo State Secondary School" (DEMO-SSS) — a fictional school
--   * five synthetic pupils, Student1..Student5, with invented marks,
--     attendance, conduct records and report books
--   * a second tenant (QB-SSS) created while testing multi-tenancy
--   * demo staff: a.ramdin@demo-sss.mu holds BOTH form_teacher and usher so a
--     single login can reach every screen — an arrangement no real school
--     should have, since the Usher is a distinct post
--
-- Loading this alongside real pupils would mix invented records with genuine
-- ones in the same tables. For a real school, load the schema
